    description: 'Offshore trolling for Bluefin Tuna, Swordfish, Albacore and big pelagics with a technical long-range approach.',
    features: ['Food & Drinks', 'Rod, Reel and Tackle', 'Max 4 person'],
    pricing: '8h — €900/group'
  },
  {
    id: 3,
    title: 'Inshore Trolling',
