          <p class="faq-answer mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Partiamo da Roma e Fiumicino, con uscite dedicate al Mar Tirreno e alle zone di pesca più productive.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="faq-question text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Quanti partecipanti possono essere a bordo?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Le nostre uscite sono pensate per gruppi fino a 4 persone, per garantire spazio, comfort e massima attenzione.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="gallery" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-cyan-50 to-blue-50 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-sky-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white shadow-md shadow-cyan-400/30">Gallery</span>
        <h2 id="gallery-title" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Momenti in mare</h2>
        <p id="gallery-subtitle" class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base text-slate-500">Ogni uscita è una storia. Sfoglia i momenti catturati a bordo.</p>
      </div>

      {galleryMedia.length > 0 ? (
        <div class="relative mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <div id="gallery-carousel-track" class="flex transition-transform duration-500 ease-out">
            {galleryMedia.map((media, index) => (
              <button type="button" class="gallery-slide group relative flex-shrink-0 cursor-pointer text-left" data-index={index} data-src={media.src} data-type={media.type} data-alt={media.alt} aria-label={`Open ${media.type}: ${media.alt}`}>
                {media.type === 'video' ? (
                  <video src={media.src} class="aspect-[16/9] h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" muted loop autoplay playsinline preload="metadata" />
                ) : (
                  <img src={media.src} alt={media.alt} class="aspect-[16/9] h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
                )}
                <p class="border-t border-slate-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-500">{media.alt}</p>
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ) : (
        <p class="mt-6 text-center text-slate-500">Nessun file trovato in public/gallery.</p>
      )}
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="trip-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[70] hidden items-center justify-center bg-slate-950/90 p-3 sm:p-4">
    <button
      type="button"
      id="trip-modal-close"
      class="absolute right-3 top-3 z-10 rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white/90 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-100 sm:right-4 sm:top-4"
      aria-label="Chiudi dettagli uscita"
    >
      Chiudi
    </button>

    <div class="flex max-h-[90dvh] w-full max-w-3xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-2xl">
      <div class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="space-y-3 p-4 sm:space-y-4 sm:p-6">
          <h3 id="trip-modal-title" class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl"></h3>
          <p id="trip-modal-start" class="text-sm text-slate-500"></p>
          <div id="trip-modal-pricing" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 ring-1 ring-amber-200"></div>
          <div id="trip-modal-features" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
          <p id="trip-modal-description" class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

